      "username": "asieftejani",
      "name": "Asief Tejani",
      "created_at": "2025-12-30T06:19:25.871Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Try these 2 if they are similar to your situation: -</p>\n<aside class=\"quote\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"157445\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/francis1/48/44205_2.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <div class=\"quote-title__text-content\">\n      <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/item-tax-does-not-really-work-in-erpnext-if-you-have-more-than-2-tax-templates/157445\">Item Tax does not really work in ERPNext if you have more than 2 tax templates</a> \n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    Item Tax does not really work in ERPNext if you have more than 2 tax templates , have anyone ever used it in ERPNext , it looks like only way is to create a custom app to handle tax in ERPNext , have researched through and it looks like thats the only way . Have anyone ever faced same problem ?\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p>&amp;</p>\n<aside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"156809\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/shiraz_ki/48/32632_2.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <div class=\"quote-title__text-content\">\n      <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/item-tax-template-and-purchase-tax-template-and-sales-tax-template-correct-approach-explain-please/156809\">Item tax template and Purchase tax template and sales tax template Correct approach explain please</a> \n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    I create 2 Ledger account in duty’s and tax account under. check screen short \n <a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/f/8fb228989d2ade2a70640091c7d8a77c68beece1.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/8fb228989d2ade2a70640091c7d8a77c68beece1\" title=\"image\">[image]</a> \nafter i create asset side 2 ledger for input vat 5 and 15% \n <a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/b/dbc21ac6d06af525ad7c4d9c475fe8ab6ba25708.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/dbc21ac6d06af525ad7c4d9c475fe8ab6ba25708\" title=\"image\">[image]</a> \nNow both ledger ready now i need setup item tax template for 2 tax so i create 2 template like this \nbut link with one ledger for each template input side ledger \n <a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/9/b9271c21cc67df51ceadd0c64b949b8a3ad8d647.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b9271c21cc67df51ceadd0c64b949b8a3ad8d647\" title=\"image\">[image]</a> \nNow i create purchase tax template like this \n <a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/8/c8119531980815affa725417abc86b28c0887cf7.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c8119531980815affa725417abc86b28c0887cf7\" title=\"image\">[image]</a> \nSo the real problem is i cant setup 2 tax for 2 template bcz i have around 5000product with mixed tax rate so we…\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n",
