      "created_at": "2026-01-06T14:43:10.006Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/francis1\">@francis1</a> <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ayesha\">@Ayesha</a></p>\n<p><strong>Tax Category</strong> can serve the purpose of filtration and bring relevant item tax templates on transaction level.</p>\n<p>It can be easily set on item group level as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/1/e18a82263ec0d55761a455de315e0d5a6a0f75aa.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e18a82263ec0d55761a455de315e0d5a6a0f75aa\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/1/e18a82263ec0d55761a455de315e0d5a6a0f75aa_2_690x313.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"wbebodRtjhuijDpOTutiaw5FWGe\" width=\"690\" height=\"313\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/1/e18a82263ec0d55761a455de315e0d5a6a0f75aa_2_690x313.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/1/e18a82263ec0d55761a455de315e0d5a6a0f75aa_2_1035x469.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/1/e18a82263ec0d55761a455de315e0d5a6a0f75aa_2_1380x626.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1871×850 89 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/asieftejani\">@asieftejani</a></p>\n<p>Please do not write irrelevant and chatgpt kind of posts as those are not serving any purpose and misleading users.</p>",
